# NumPy 2 – Python Numerical Computing

This project demonstrates the use of NumPy in Python for numerical computing and array manipulation. It covers array creation, indexing, slicing, mathematical operations, statistical functions, and multidimensional arrays.

## Topics Covered
- NumPy Array Creation
- Array Indexing and Slicing
- Array Operations
- Mathematical Functions
- Statistical Operations
- Multidimensional Arrays
- Array Reshaping

## Technologies Used
- Python
- NumPy

## Objective
To understand NumPy fundamentals and develop practical skills in numerical computing and data manipulation.
